---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';

const title = "电池行业周刊 — 2026年第37周 | 电池计算器";
const description = "本周电池资讯：澳大利亚已就绪项目因风险投资式回报消失沦为'笑柄'，Octopus Australia将2GWh Blackstone BESS提交昆士兰州EPBC法案评估，2027年2月起的欧盟电池护照：欧洲买家将向印度出口商要求什么——T&D India。";
const canonical = "https://batterycalculators.com/zh/news/battery-industry-weekly-2026-week-37";
const publishDate = "2026-09-16";
const lastUpdated = "2026-09-16";
const readingTime = 24;

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: '资讯', href: '/zh/news' },
  { label: '2026年第37周' },
];
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  ogType="article"
  schema="webApplication"
  schemaName="电池行业周刊 — 2026年第37周"
  schemaDescription={description}
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  lang="zh"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
      <a href="/zh/news" class="text-label-uppercase text-xs text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-4 inline-block">&larr; 返回资讯</a>
      <Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbs} />
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-xs block mb-4">每周期刊</span>
      <h1 class="text-display-md text-primary mb-4">电池行业周刊 — 第37周</h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-caption text-muted mb-6">
        <span>9月7日 – 9月13日, 2026</span>
        <span>{readingTime} 分钟阅读</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light">
        本周电池资讯：澳大利亚已就绪项目因风险投资式回报消失沦为"笑柄"，Octopus Australia将2GWh Blackstone BESS提交昆士兰州EPBC法案评估，2027年2月起的欧盟电池护照：欧洲买家将向印度出口商要求什么——T&D India。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Story 1 -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">研究</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">澳大利亚已就绪项目因风险投资式回报消失沦为"笑柄"</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">据Battery Asset Management Summit Australia 2026的小组讨论者称，澳大利亚曾经可获得的风险投资式回报已经消失。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 2 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">Octopus Australia将2GWh Blackstone BESS提交昆士兰州EPBC法案评估</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">Octopus Australia已将Blackstone电池储能系统（BESS），一座500MW/2,000MWh独立设施，提交澳大利亚联邦政府根据环境保</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 3 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">法规</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">2027年2月起的欧盟电池护照：欧洲买家将向印度出口商要求什么</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">自2027年2月起，欧盟电池护照将正式生效，欧洲买家将要求印度出口商提供碳足迹、材料溯源和合规文档等一系列信息。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 4 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">研究</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">固态电池周报 | 稳步推进——热度降温，努力加强</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">固态电池领域正在稳步推进，市场炒作趋于理性，而技术攻关力度持续加强。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 5 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">研究</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">钠离子电池即将登陆欧洲</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">钠离子电池技术正在向欧洲市场迈进，为大规模储能和低速电动车等应用场景提供新的选择。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 6 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">Vattenfall在德国前核电站址推进1GWh电池储能项目</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">2026年9月14日更新：Vattenfall代表提供了更多细节并回应了Energy-Storage.news的询问。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 7 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">研究</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">Ore Energy铁空气技术：LDES应用、权衡、部署与下一代电芯</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">我们深入探讨初创企业Ore Energy的铁空气电池技术，包括其工作原理以及在最近完成4300万美元融资后的技术发展方向。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 8 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">船舶</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">CATL升至AAA级，Wärtsilä降至BB级——Bankability Report Q2更新</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">全球电池储能市场正在进入新阶段，电芯价格变动、竞争加剧和快速国际扩张正在重塑供应商格局。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 9 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">研究</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">CATL、EVE Energy引领中国制造商电池储能电芯涨价潮</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">新一轮电芯涨价潮正在席卷电池储能行业。</p>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light">主要制造商已启动提价，小型生产商也迅速跟进。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Story 10 -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">BESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-title-xl text-primary mb-4">Energy Fiji与EPC Renewables合作开发240MWh光储一体化项目</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">EPC Renewables已与国有公用事业公司Energy Fiji Limited签署谅解备忘录，共同开发Yaqara太阳能与电池项目。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Analysis -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-primary mb-6">本周聚焦</h2>
      <div class="bg-surface-card border border-hairline p-6">
        <p class="text-body-md text-body font-light mb-4">
          本周新闻中值得追踪的三大主题：
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-body-sm text-muted">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary">规模化已成新常态。</strong> 电池部署在各细分领域持续增长——电动汽车、电网储能和船舶——使电池成为核心技术基础设施，而非小众市场。
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary">化学体系多元化加速。</strong> LFP、固态、钠离子和硅负极化学体系均在同步推进，各自针对不同的成本和性能权衡。
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary">法规正在重塑供应链。</strong> 欧盟电池护照要求和国内制造激励政策迫使企业重新思考采购、文档和合规时间线。
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What to Watch -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-primary mb-6">下周关注</h2>
      <div class="bg-surface-card border border-hairline p-6">
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-body-sm text-muted list-disc pl-5">
          <li>固态电池商业化时间线的持续更新</li>
          <li>欧盟委员会关于EU电池法规实施指南</li>
          <li>新电网级BESS项目投运和容量里程碑报告</li>
          <li>影响电池经济性的锂和关键矿石价格趋势</li>
          <li>钠离子和下一代化学体系产能扩张公告</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <section class="mb-12 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <h2 class="text-display-sm text-primary mb-4">来源</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-body-sm text-muted list-disc pl-5">
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/ready-to-build-projects-become-laughing-stock-as-venture-capital-style-returns-disappear-in-australia/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">澳大利亚已就绪项目因风险投资式回报消失沦为"笑柄" — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/octopus-australia-refers-2gwh-blackstone-bess-for-epbc-act-assessment-in-queensland/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Octopus Australia将2GWh Blackstone BESS提交昆士兰州EPBC法案评估 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">2027年2月起的欧盟电池护照：欧洲买家将向印度出口商要求什么 — Google News - Battery Passport</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQczRWXzZOXzJfLWFWWjlHMV9xN2gtRnNydDZ1ZFJvNWxSNGJFMkptMHRlUHhlMEFlSjAxWjBQWENfSmsyeEtOdmduU1VBSUs2Tkk4X3RseEZfVzFXYlMyeWdBUFhLUk9USUgzczB1RE1Kb1RBVUJpV21EejJkN0xqa0JoejN2c0hZOVBoUXhtMlpIRGE0Rm5iSGo2V1BocnZkVm5CWVR4bF9YSWhHb081UlNHVEZIc2I4VDFyak93?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">固态电池周报 | 稳步推进——热度降温，努力加强 — Google News - Solid State Battery</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE1DN3VKSmMtZDIybDFnc1FFalI0NUpqUkF5X2RfbkltcnpuZUdnTkhqM3V2N21VYnhwcm5veENKd3ExNTlWcXJRMnV2bFNWcGJ4bFpiVzJsdnhIUjFHRUs0a0EyWTk0cVJEcEYzanFNSEs2ZWFPaGxfQldoMA?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">钠离子电池即将登陆欧洲 — Google News - Sodium Ion Battery</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/vattenfall-goes-ahead-with-1gwh-battery-storage-project-at-former-nuclear-site-in-germany/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vattenfall在德国前核电站址推进1GWh电池储能项目 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/ore-energys-iron-air-technology-ldes-applications-trade-offs-deployments-and-next-gen-cells/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ore Energy铁空气技术：LDES应用、权衡、部署与下一代电芯 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/catl-upgraded-to-aaa-wartsila-downgraded-to-bb-in-bankability-report-q2-update/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CATL升至AAA级，Wärtsilä降至BB级——Bankability Report Q2更新 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/catl-eve-energy-lead-chinese-manufacturers-battery-storage-cell-price-hikes/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CATL、EVE Energy引领中国制造商电池储能电芯涨价潮 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/energy-fiji-partners-with-epc-renewables-on-240mwh-solar-plus-storage-site/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Energy Fiji与EPC Renewables合作开发240MWh光储一体化项目 — Energy Storage News</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Disclaimer -->
    <section class="mb-16 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline p-6">
        <h3 class="text-title-lg text-primary mb-3">免责声明</h3>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-muted">
          本文总结了公开可用的新闻和分析。BatteryCalculators.com不保证第三方信息的准确性。在做出工程或采购决策前，请务必通过主要来源核实事实。本内容仅供参考，不构成专业工程建议。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </article>
</Layout>
